// Canonical native/Python route guard policy.
//
// Keep this file deliberately simple: C++ consumes it as an X-macro and
// x64dbg.py parses the same rows.  Every native route must appear exactly once.
// NONE is read-only, BRIDGE mutates debugger-owned state, SESSION mutates the
// active target, and EXEC_DYNAMIC selects BRIDGE for init/initdbg/attach and
// SESSION for every other raw command.
